        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a small café to a place with a unique atmosphere</h2>Start your adventure with a modest space and expand it into an elegant café where everyone will want to stop in for a cup of aromatic coffee and a fresh dessert. Create an atmosphere that will make your place unique.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/8b37940e5e0c222db6b328f7ccf06384.poster.avif?t=1783534094\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/8b37940e5e0c222db6b328f7ccf06384.webm?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/8b37940e5e0c222db6b328f7ccf06384.mp4?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve the best products</h2>Break the perfect coffee and fresh juices. Diversify your offerings with cakes, croissants, muffins, and ice cream sundaes. Ensure quality and freshness so even the most discerning customers are delighted.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/2755b46bd986f9d864faa3d0cc5f745a.poster.avif?t=1783534094\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/2755b46bd986f9d864faa3d0cc5f745a.webm?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/2755b46bd986f9d864faa3d0cc5f745a.mp4?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand and decorate your café</h2>Add new tables, chairs, cabinets, and refrigerators to make your place increasingly functional and attractive. Create a cozy interior by decorating it with paintings and plants. Your café will attract guests not only with its flavor but also with its atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/5ee6f30b7c5c1072995674d190d0ead6.poster.avif?t=1783534094\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/5ee6f30b7c5c1072995674d190d0ead6.webm?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/5ee6f30b7c5c1072995674d190d0ead6.mp4?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Management and Success</h2>Serve customers efficiently and professionally. Fulfill orders, accept cash or card payments, maintain inventory, and improve your offerings daily. Over time, you can become a true coffee shop tycoon, winning the hearts of customers and reaping ever-increasing profits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/4c69c04f350f4dd2a6ead3358b33d4a8.poster.avif?t=1783534094\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/4c69c04f350f4dd2a6ead3358b33d4a8.webm?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/4c69c04f350f4dd2a6ead3358b33d4a8.mp4?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a small café to a place with a unique atmosphere</h2>Start your adventure with a modest space and expand it into an elegant café where everyone will want to stop in for a cup of aromatic coffee and a fresh dessert. Create an atmosphere that will make your place unique.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/8b37940e5e0c222db6b328f7ccf06384.poster.avif?t=1783534094\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/8b37940e5e0c222db6b328f7ccf06384.webm?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/8b37940e5e0c222db6b328f7ccf06384.mp4?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve the best products</h2>Break the perfect coffee and fresh juices. Diversify your offerings with cakes, croissants, muffins, and ice cream sundaes. Ensure quality and freshness so even the most discerning customers are delighted.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/2755b46bd986f9d864faa3d0cc5f745a.poster.avif?t=1783534094\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/2755b46bd986f9d864faa3d0cc5f745a.webm?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/2755b46bd986f9d864faa3d0cc5f745a.mp4?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand and decorate your café</h2>Add new tables, chairs, cabinets, and refrigerators to make your place increasingly functional and attractive. Create a cozy interior by decorating it with paintings and plants. Your café will attract guests not only with its flavor but also with its atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/5ee6f30b7c5c1072995674d190d0ead6.poster.avif?t=1783534094\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/5ee6f30b7c5c1072995674d190d0ead6.webm?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/5ee6f30b7c5c1072995674d190d0ead6.mp4?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Management and Success</h2>Serve customers efficiently and professionally. Fulfill orders, accept cash or card payments, maintain inventory, and improve your offerings daily. Over time, you can become a true coffee shop tycoon, winning the hearts of customers and reaping ever-increasing profits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/4c69c04f350f4dd2a6ead3358b33d4a8.poster.avif?t=1783534094\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/4c69c04f350f4dd2a6ead3358b33d4a8.webm?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/extras/4c69c04f350f4dd2a6ead3358b33d4a8.mp4?t=1783534094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
